Bubble Bobble native Amiga DEMO

Five ordinary rounds; five minutes of active gameplay per new game.
Menus, pause and intro do not spend the clock. Level restarts do not refill it.
Clear round5 or reach the time limit to finish and enter qualifying scores.
Stock14MHz68020 AGA,2MBChip +8MBFast; simultaneous1P/2P.
Run WHDLoad SLAVE=BubbleBobble.slave NOMMU CACHE from this directory.
Supply your own A1200 Kickstart40.068 and relocation file.
P1 arrows,Z/Alt bubble,X/Shift jump. P2 A/D,F/G; controllers A/B.
1/2 start or join;5/6 credits;F1/Escape/active Start pause;R restart.
Options: FPS, soundtrack mode, all11 Amiga recordings, sound effects.
Demo scores/settings save separately as demo-scores.dat.
Native reconstruction; advanced arcade mechanics remain incomplete.
